/*******************************************************************
 * XA transaction statements. spirit refuses XA workloads, but the
 * parser must recognize them so pkg/change can do so cleanly.
 * See https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/xa-statements.html
 *******************************************************************/
XAStmt:
